Darwin fdwalk(): size the proc_pidinfo(PROC_PIDLISTFDS) buffer from the fds
actually open instead of RLIMIT_NOFILE. With a high limit (1048576) the VLA
was 8 MiB and overflowed the stack: the app crashed spawning its shell.
Against VTE 0.84.1. Upstream candidate.

